{"version":1,"content":"<p>ViuTV劇集《地獄大狀》演員林愷鈴和張達倫，接受新城知訊台節目《放飯ICU》訪問，分享拍攝《地獄大狀》最新故事。</p><p>作為劇中核心角色，林愷鈴笑言當初經歷多輪試鏡，才獲得角色，並在開鏡前1個月開始做重訓，希望藉訓練令自身氣勢更硬朗。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T13:19:39.830660+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T12:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T12:37:40.196418+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T13:17:41.178247+00:00","content_hash":"9605b7674b2e4288ff123cb2fb0dcce94116a76b74206d229fa8975e12b723d7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}